WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.920
Dr. Zemyla Cenh decided to test SCP-914&nbsp;
with two identical wooden cross pendants,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:09.440
each measuring three inches in length.
The first cross was run through the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:13.760
machinery on Rough. It produced one fragment&nbsp;
of wood, with the same mass, which was cut&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:19.120
flat on three sides. This was hypothesized&nbsp;
to be a portion of a much larger cross.&nbsp;

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:22.880
The second cross, run through the clockwork&nbsp;
on the setting Fine, produced a wooden&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:27.680
crucifix carved with an ornate depiction of&nbsp;
Jesus Christ. Dr. Cenh proposed that these&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:34.000
results indicate SCP-914 understands religion.
Dr. Pyrrhus suggested that these results imply&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.160
SCP-914 understands the use of the objects put&nbsp;
into it, and their meaning on a cultural level.

